# ACHIEVE_LEVEL and the level-up re-entry: a level 29 Warrior with the exp rate at 20 takes 1200 (Level 30 Warrior,
# retro: its check fails at the take) and 2. The kill completes 2, its addExp levels the char up, which re-enters the
# dispatch with ACHIEVE_LEVEL, and 1200 completes inside 2's completion.
char zone=WestRonfaure pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=29
setting ROE_EXP_RATE 20
login
tick 2000
record take 1200
record take 2
kill #17186822
